  "description": "E-MTB genes spliced with Trekking amenities: The Bergamont E-Horizon SUV FS shares its frame with the Bergamont E-Revox FS range of e-mountain bikes. A dual suspension setup with 130 mm of travel ensures a very comfortable and less fatiguing ride. The suspension also improves control over your bike even in adverse riding conditions on paved or gravel roads, which results in a safer ride, especially over longer distances.\n\nThe Bosch Performance Line CX electric drive system offers powerful and long-lasting support, giving you the freedom to explore beyond your usual routes and prepare for new adventures. The end of the road is definitely not the end of your ride with the Bergamont E-Horizon SUV FS. To complete the package the E-Horizon SUV FS has an increased maximum system weight of 160 kg and is conveniently equipped with LED lights, fenders, a rear carrier and a kickstand.\n\nThe high-capacity Bosch PowerTube battery integrated into the frame can be removed for remote charging. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: Use the eBike Flow App to control your bike or add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range.",
